// `std.env`: the home of the environment's host interface, `std.env.Eff`,
// whose operations read a variable and the executable search path. A source
// names the interface where it imports this module, `import std.env;`, and
// nowhere else. The interface is native, so no declaration here
// states it. The functions over `main`'s authority wait for demand.
//
// - see: #4523
